  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity FAO/UNICEF From Protection to Production: the Economic Impacts of Direct Cash Transfers To Poor People in Africa (Growth Team component) is a component of FAO/UNICEF From Protection To Production: The Economic Impacts Of Direct Cash Transfers To Poor People In Africa reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xa3;502,401. This project benefits Africa, regional. It works in the following sector(s): Research/scientific institutions, Social Protection.</narrative>
  </description>
